      "summary": "A limit that would never be reached is refused before any call, with `AI0001`: `maxRepairs`, `retry.attempts` and an agent's `maxToolRounds` and `budget.turns` must be whole numbers of at least 0, and `budget.tokens`, `budget.ms` and `budget.cost` finite numbers of at least 0. Before, `maxRepairs: Infinity` repaired without end and a NaN turn budget never stopped a run; `maxRepairs: -1` made no call and returned a failure with no errors. A structured result's `attempts` is the number of calls made.",
      "id": "count-limits"
    },
